    "text": "Confessio et Oratio. Eala \u00feu \u00e6lmihtiga god unasecgendlicere mildheortnesse, eala \u00feu god unametenre\nIc bidde mid ealre geomerunge \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu \u00f0urh menigfealdnysse \u00feinra mildheortnyssa me forgife \u00fe\u00e6t ic\n& ic so\u00f0e d\u00e6dbote \u00e6tforan \u00fee don mote be eallum \u00feam synnum \u00fee ic gesyngode on yfelum ge\u00feohtum &\nIc syngode on gesih\u00f0e & swi\u00f0e on hlyste, eac on sw\u00e6cce, on stence & on hrewunge.\n\u00deu leofa drihten ealle lima me gesceope to menniscum bricum gem\u00e6te & gelimplice ac ic earming hi\nIc on ofermettum oft swi\u00f0e agylte & \u00feurh upahefednysse me to foran o\u00ferum tealde & \u00feine beboda\n& ic nolde wegan \u00fein wynsume geocne, \u00f0ine leohtan byr\u00feene on minum b\u00e6ce ferian & ic unw\u00e6rlice\nIc on gyfernysse & on oferfylle & on druncennysse wi\u00f0 \u00fee drihten agylte oft & gelome on untiman.\nIc eac earming ofer \u00e6lcum gemete on fulum forligre & on fracodre galnysse me sylfne befylde ge on\nIc on gitsunge mid gitsigendum mode swi\u00f0e oft agylte & beswac o\u00f0re \u00e6t heora \u00e6htum \u00feurh \u00fea\nIc \u00feurh weamodnysse worhte fela yfela & \u00feurh manslihtas me scyldigne dyde wi\u00f0 \u00fee min h\u00e6lend \u00fea \u00fea\nNu synd mine handa \u00feurh \u00feone hefian gylt mid manna blodum \u00fee ic \u00feurh gebeot oft & \u00feurh\nIc on unrotnysse oft eac agylte & swi\u00f0or ceorude \u00feonne min sawul behofode \u00fea \u00f0a ic \u00e6hta forleas o\u00f0\u00f0e\n& ic \u00fea ongean \u00fee drihten dyrstiglice ceorode \u00feurh \u00fea unrotnysse \u00fee is dea\u00f0es wyrcend.\nIn syngode gelome \u00feurh asolcennysse \u00fea \u00fea me god ne lyste don ne gan to godes huse ne nan ellen\nAc ic leofode min lif lange on asolcennysse butan godum weorcum & godum biggenge.\nIc on idelum wuldre eac swylce agylte on gylp licere spr\u00e6ce & gylpes cewte & wolde beon gehered\n& on wlence ic ferde \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t idele wuldor & manna lyffetunge ic lufode to swi\u00f0e & on menigfealdre\nOn eallum \u00feisum heafod leahtrum ic healice agylte & o\u00f0rum l\u00e6ssum gyltum ic gelome syngode & ic\nIc bidde swa \u00feeah drihten \u00fe\u00e6t hi beon \u00fee geandette mid so\u00f0re behreowsunge & \u00feu mine sawle geh\u00e6le\n\u00d0u sealdest us h\u00e6lend healicne truwan \u00feurh ezechiel cwe\u00feende \u00feinne so\u00f0an witegan, gif se arleasa de\u00f0\n& ic ne gemune ealra his mand\u00e6da ac he leofa\u00f0 on his rihtwisnysse \u00fee hesylf geworhte.\nEac \u00feu sylf drihten s\u00e6dest on \u00feinum godspelle \u00fe\u00e6t mare bliss bi\u00f0 on heofonum be anum synfullan men\nUnderfoh me nu drihten for \u00feinre mildheortnysse & a\u00feweah me \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6s halgan gastes gife fram\nNel \u00e6t \u00feu me \u00e6fre bugan to \u00feam \u00e6rran leahtrum \u00fee ic receleas gefremode fullice for oft ac geedsta\u00f0ela\nGescylde me, drihten, wi\u00f0 \u00feone swicolan deofol \u00fe\u00e6t he me earmne oft ne beswice for\u00fean \u00fee min\n\u00d0u miht eall \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu wylt swa swa \u00e6lmihtig god & \u00feu naht ne swincst \u00feeah \u00feu gescylde us heald me for\nIc bidde \u00fee nu, h\u00e6lend, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu geh\u00e6le mine sawle \u00fe\u00e6t ic d\u00e6lnimend beo on \u00feam forman \u00e6riste swa\nSyle me nu scyppend ges\u00e6lig ge\u00feanc & \u00fea halgan mihte \u00fee men \u00feurh ge\u00feeo\u00f0 geleafan & hiht & halige\n& syle me forgifennysse ealra minra synna & \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif \u00e6fter \u00feisum l\u00e6nan life.\nH\u00e6lend crist, gehyr \u00feas word \u00feu \u00f0e leofast & rixast mid \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan f\u00e6der & \u00feam halgan gaste",
